(n)
"net-worth" means the paid-up share capital of a company plus free reserve, if any, and surpluses excluding outside
investments which are not readily available for operational activity;
(o)
"non-Scheduled bulk drug" means a bulk drug not specified in the First Schedule;
(p)
"non-Scheduled formulation" means a formulation not containing any bulk drug specified in the First Schedule;
(q)
"pre-tax return" means profits before payment of income-tax and surtax and includes such other expenses as do not
form part of the cost of formulation;
(r)
"price list" means a price list referred to in paragraphs 14 and 15 and includes a supplementary price list;
(s)
"retail price" means the retail price of a drug arrived at or fixed in accordance with the provisions of this Order and
includes a ceiling price;
(t)
"retailer" means a dealer carrying on the retail business of sale of drugs to customers;
(u)
"Scheduled bulk drug" means a bulk drug specified in the First Schedule;

